{
    "background_story": "Handsome was a majestic thoroughbred with a gleaming black coat and a spirited personality to match. But what made him truly unique was the sprig of white on his forehead, shaped like a tiny star. According to legend, this marking was a sign of good luck and strength. Handsome's owner, a young jockey named Emma, believed in the legend and pampered him accordingly. She adorned his bridle with a sprig of rosemary, said to enhance his focus and agility. As Handsome galloped across the track, the rosemary sprig fluttering in the wind, he seemed almost invincible. Together, Emma and Handsome won numerous competitions, their bond and teamwork proving unbeatable. The sprig of rosemary became a trademark of sorts, symbolizing the magic that happened when Handsome's natural talent met Emma's devotion.",
